@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #0b7a75
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #6b7280
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0b7a75
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #fdfdfd
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f3f4f6
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9ca3af

title Page flow: clinicalTrial\nA client utterance builds the clinicalTrial page against an external registry we do not own

actor "Person / Client" as P
participant "Gate\n(facade, transport only)" as Gate
participant "UniversalNavigator\n(SharedServices main)" as UN
database "Registry\n(the one live map)" as Reg
database "Repository\nsessions, ledger, params" as Repo
participant "UtteranceManager\n(classifies + dispatches;\nRequestUsersRefinement capability)" as UM
participant "UniversalNavigatorProxy\n(FindCare satellite)" as PXY
participant "ClinicalTrials\n(tool, required member)" as CT
participant "ClinicalTrials.gov\n(external registry, not ours)" as REG

P -> Gate : POST /  { session_token, head,\nparams(utterance, history) }
activate Gate
note over Gate
  Transport only. The gate collects the token, the HTTP head and
  the POST/GET params, each if present, and hands them on. It owns
  no route and verifies nothing.
end note

Gate -> UN : navigate(session_token, head, params)
activate UN

note left of UN
  TRIAGE by declared proof: a session_token is present, so this is a
  client_sessioned call. The UN is the only node that takes external
  traffic; it verifies the proof, no one upstream does.
end note
UN -> Repo : verify session_token, advance nonce,\nload parameters in force
Repo --> UN : session ok, in-force parameters
UN -> Reg : the live map for this env\n(routes, may_call, pages)
Reg --> UN : routes + dependencies + page definitions

UN -> UN : determine page = clinicalTrial\nmembers { ClinicalTrials, clinical_trial_detail }\nrequired_members { ClinicalTrials }

note over UN
  Three pages only: individualProvider, facility, clinicalTrial.
  clinical_trial_detail is a VIEW / member of this page, not a page,
  and today it is painted by the cached React widget - no tool and
  no route serve it (EPIC-006-F-004-S-001 is the gap).
  Geo is NOT a member here: free-text geography resolution is scoped
  to individualProvider + facility; this page takes only us_only.
end note

UN -> UM : classify(utterance, history)\nscoped to the clinicalTrial members
activate UM
UM --> UN : dispatch set { ClinicalTrials }
deactivate UM
note right of UM
  One model call: cached preamble plus the page's fragments in,
  routes out. On refinement the UN scopes mining to this page's
  members. The UM knows no parameters and never waits on a tool.
end note

UN -> Repo : render ledger: record required_members\n{ ClinicalTrials } as the page expectation
note left of Repo
  Page lifecycle: dispatch records the expectation; the completion
  callback closes it; the render_timeout budget races the callback.
end note

UN -> PXY : dispatch ClinicalTrials\n{ condition, age?, sex?, us_only? }  tool_to_tool
activate PXY
PXY -> CT : relay locally (function call)
activate CT
CT -> REG : query by condition\n(narrowed by age / sex / US when given)
activate REG
REG --> CT : matching trials + total count
deactivate REG
note over CT, REG
  The registry is external and not ChatHealthy's (EPIC-006-F-005).
  A condition alone suffices; nothing else is required of the user.
  We state what we ask and what must come back, not how it answers.
end note
CT --> PXY : trials document\n{ trials, UserRefinementRequestText }
deactivate CT
note over CT
  UserRefinementRequestText on the tool output: populated => the tool
  is ASKING the user, which the UM delivers via RequestUsersRefinement(question);
  empty => the tool is answering.
end note
PXY --> UN : completion callback { trials }\ninternal_callback, proof our_signature
deactivate PXY

UN -> Repo : close the ledger entry, then serial\ndeterministic merge (a conflict RAISES)
UN -> UN : reconcile - required member ClinicalTrials\nclosed within budget => page complete

note over UN, Repo
  Page error management (render ledger):
  - timeout: budget expires -> UN responds with the layman on_timeout text
  - conflict: a parameter/state merge conflict -> raise
  - missing-required: ClinicalTrials dead or never returning -> raise
  Every case instrumented with timings, at a severity matching impact.
  Every throw ends here in the UN; a middle tool re-raises, never swallows.
end note

alt only a condition was given
  UN -> UM : RequestUsersRefinement(): author refinement sentence\n{ narrowings not yet used: age, sex, US }
  activate UM
  UM --> UN : the user-facing sentence
  deactivate UM
  note right of UM
    RequestUsersRefinement is a CAPABILITY of the UtteranceManager,
    not a separate tool - the one conversational surface. Two forms:
    RequestUsersRefinement() - the UM's own LLM authors the question
    when classification finds no route or a missing slot (this call);
    RequestUsersRefinement(question) - a dispatched tool authored the
    question (carried in UserRefinementRequestText) and the UM delivers it.
    No tool authors its own chat strings.
    Offering refinements not yet given is EPIC-006-F-005-S-001.
  end note
end

UN --> Gate : the reconciled page, sequenced
deactivate UN
P <-- Gate : the one stream the gate writes
deactivate Gate

@enduml
